OL,6,     FFull commentary from Pittodrie as
OL,7,     FAberdeen take on Queen's Park in
OL,8,     Fthe Scottish League Cup.
OL,9,G1900 Take the Floor
OL,10,     FFor the very best in traditional
OL,11,     Fmusic, join Gary Innes for Take
OL,12,     Fthe Floor. We treat you to a great
OL,13,     Fband session from Sandy Nixon and
OL,14,     Fhis Scottish Dance Band.
OL,15,G2100 Piping Sounds
OL,16,     FEwen Henderson takes us on a
OL,17,     Fpiping tour of Uist, focusing on
OL,18,     Fthe pipers and the tunes of the
OL,19,     Fislands. Amoung the players are
OL,20,     FSeonaidh MacIntyre, Willie
OL,21,     FMorrison and Fred Morrison.
